<title>USA: Piedmont Natural Gas completes $7 mln line.</title>
<headline>Piedmont Natural Gas completes $7 mln line.</headline>
<dateline>CHARLOTTE, N.C. 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Piedmont Natural Gas Co Inc said Friday it has completed a $7 million pipeline project in Forsyth County, N.C.</p>
<p>The company said it is ready to use the 8.5-mile line to connect the Forsyth County section of the town of King to its gas network.</p>
<p>The company said the line is expected to serve 900 residential customers and 43 commercial and industrial customers.</p>
</text>
